WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.500
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.500
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:15.900
It's really lively here, isn't it?

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:19.700
Yeah. It seems that little
has changed in Rithmere.

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:25.600
How's that? It doesn't get cheaper
than this! Come and get 'em!

00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:28.700
The most excellent food for your cats!

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:30.100
It's oh-so cheap!

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:31.200
He's a scammer!

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:32.400
Give back my money!

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:33.300
What a bastard!

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:35.200
I told you to give my money back!

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:36.100
There he is!

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:37.100
Stay right there!

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:38.200
You're not getting away!

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:39.400
He's over there!

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:41.900
Yeah, it really is the same as always.

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:54.300
What was that?

00:02:57.700 --> 00:02:58.700
That's...

00:02:58.700 --> 00:02:59.800
a polypan!

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:09.000
Hold on...

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.500
that means...

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:11.800
Our money!

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:16.200
Looks like it didn't pick my pockets.

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:17.800
I'm also safe.

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:19.000
Oh no!

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:20.400
Jasmine?

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.400
Were you robbed?!

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:22.900
No, I wasn't,

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:24.000
but Filli is...

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:26.880
Filli is gone!

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:43.100
Alright, good job!

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:44.700
Here you go.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:49.600
Well now, what's today's loot going to be?

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:52.860
What the hell is this?!

00:03:56.900 --> 00:04:01.400
Hey, come on now, who asked you to steal <i>this</i>?

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:07.880
Today's not my lucky day...

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:10.800
Filli!

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:10.800
Filli!

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:14.400
Filli!

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:14.400
Filli! Where are you?

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:19.400
It's no use. I still can't find him.

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:21.600
How about you?

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:25.900
Though, about that polypan...

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:28.110
Why would it kidnap Filli?

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:35.200
Really?

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:39.100
Jasmine, where are you going?

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:43.000
Kree said that he saw a polypan
in the northern part of the city!

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:49.700
I-I'm terribly sorry...

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:57.020
The deadline for your debt
repayment was yesterday, correct?

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:02.400
U-Um... that's...

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:07.100
Th-Three days... n-no, in two
days, I'll definitely have it...!

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:10.800
N-No...

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:15.300
G-Give me a day and a half...!

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:17.700
Don't give me that crap!!

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:27.250
It would appear that you want to become
monster bait in the Shifting Sands.

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:34.800
P-Please... s-spare my l-life...!

00:05:41.100 --> 00:05:42.680
What's so funny?

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:45.400
No! There's nothing fu-

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.600
What?

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:03.600
What is this furball?

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:08.130
W-Well, it's something that
my polypan took by mistake.

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:12.600
Mother Brightly,

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:14.200
if I'm not mistaken,

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:17.000
this thing is the one from the Games back then...

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:19.400
Yes, yes!

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:21.100
The one from back then!

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:24.600
You were with that group of three.

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:31.700
What are you yelling about all of a sudden?

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:33.400
T-This thing is...!

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.300
P-Please look at this!

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:44.100
Please listen closely.

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:48.000
Is that really true?

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:50.000
There is no doubt.

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:57.400
This furball is?

00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:58.600
Most likely.

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:03.000
Leave this thing with us.

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:04.900
I'll give you three days.

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:07.000
R-Really?!

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:08.800
This is a special case.

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:10.900
Th-Thank you very much...!

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:14.700
Now then,

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:16.700
it's been a while, hasn't it?

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:23.400
I didn't think she'd let me off the hook.

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:26.500
Looks like I got my hands
on something pretty special.

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:29.200
I guess you are pretty useful after all.

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:32.410
Today's my lucky day.

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:38.420
Now then, let's have a bite to
eat before getting back to work.

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:42.200
Welcome.

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:47.700
You know these people?

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:52.500
Could it be that the person you're looking for is...

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:54.000
him?

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:55.400
Wait!

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:57.200
Wait right there!

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:01.490
Nevermind, this really is an unlucky day!

00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:06.870
There's nowhere left to run.

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:09.700
Now, give Filli back!

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:13.600
If you're talking about that animal, I gave it away.

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:15.400
You gave him away...?

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:19.700
Why is everyone making such a
big fuss over that one animal?

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:23.000
What do you mean "that one animal"?!

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:23.000
Jasmine, calm down!

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:25.900
Filli is my precious... my precious...

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:27.800
Tell us!

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:30.000
Who did you give him to?

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:32.140
M-Mother Brightly...

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:35.100
Mother Brightly?!

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:47.800
It looks like it hasn't been
used in quite some time.

00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:50.700
Even though it used to be so lively...

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:55.100
After losing the Shadow Lord's support,

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:57.500
the fighting tournament ended,

00:08:57.500 --> 00:09:02.710
so it appears that the inn
wasn't able to make ends meet.

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:05.100
Tell us!

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:07.010
Where is Mother Brightly?

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:12.000
I-I don't know! She only
comes here to do business...

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:15.100
Keep talking nonsense and
you're going to regret it!

00:09:15.100 --> 00:09:17.600
It's true, I'm telling you!

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:20.100
<i>Mother Brightly...</i>

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:23.200
<i>What does she plan to do with Filli?</i>

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.800
Go ahead, no need to be shy.

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:35.000
Enjoy to your heart's content.

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:43.000
But really, is it true that
this is such a precious animal?

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:45.500
I'm telling you, it's true! Look!

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:51.200
"The elusive animal, Obaobopipiru."

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:54.750
To think that this thing is such a special animal.

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:57.600
If we sell it to an animal collector...

00:09:57.600 --> 00:09:59.500
We could get 100 gold coins...

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:01.730
no, it could go for 1000!

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:04.000
This thing is worth...

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:06.000
1000 gold coins...

00:10:10.900 --> 00:10:12.500
Mo-Mother Brightly!

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:14.600
Please pull yourself together!

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:16.900
I'm not dreaming, am I?

00:10:16.900 --> 00:10:19.500
I-It's not a dream!

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:24.200
Ever since the Shadow Lord left Deltora...

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:30.010
It has just been one misfortune after another.

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:36.000
The Rithmere Games came to an end,

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:38.700
and the Champion Inn went out of business.

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:41.300
And after my finances ran dry,

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:44.600
I had no choice but to find honest work...

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:48.300
From buying and selling luxury
items and jewels, to frozen desserts.

00:10:48.300 --> 00:10:50.200
I did everything!

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:52.530
But, finally...

00:10:53.100 --> 00:10:54.300
Finally!

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:59.000
This life of mediocrity is
coming to an end, right?

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:01.100
So heavy... I mean,

00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:04.500
congratulations, Mother Brightly!

00:11:07.300 --> 00:11:10.400
Come, my little 1000 gold coin friend.

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:14.900
Eat lots of food and grow
big and strong for me, okay?

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:23.400
You damn furball!

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:27.400
Mother Brightly, this is the time for patience!

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:32.300
That's right! If it gets hurt,
the 1000 gold coins will be no more!

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:38.400
You're right.

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:41.580
I'm sorry, I lost my composure for a moment there.

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:45.000
Here, say aah!

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:51.500
Now you've really done it, you goddamned furball!

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:55.200
Mother Brightly, please restrain yourself!

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:22.100
Here, say aah.

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:24.870
Aaah.

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:27.200
Come, eat up.

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:36.700
It finally ate something!

00:12:36.700 --> 00:12:37.890
Yes indeed.

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:41.700
Well? Is it tasty?

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:46.100
You bastard creature!!

00:12:46.100 --> 00:12:47.900
Mother Brightly!

00:12:47.900 --> 00:12:49.600
1000 gold coins!

00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:54.400
1000 gold coins... 1000 gold coins...

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:09.670
That vase is...!

00:13:19.800 --> 00:13:23.700
Just when I had finally
found a buyer for that vase...!

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:28.300
Mother Brightly, more importantly,
what about the 1000 gold coins?!

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:30.500
Are the 1000 gold coins safe?!

00:13:31.600 --> 00:13:33.000
You're right!

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:35.900
My little 1000 gold coins.

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:39.600
Is it dead?

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:42.400
What should I do? Hey, what should I do?

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:45.700
Perhaps we should perform
mouth-to-mouth for now?

00:13:45.700 --> 00:13:47.080
Mouth to mouth, right?

00:13:56.200 --> 00:13:57.600
You furball!

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:02.000
You... little...

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.500
Mother Brightly!

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:05.000
Please calm yourself!

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:10.800
Jasmine?

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:13.000
I felt it, just now!

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:18.100
It feels as if something terrifying
is happening to Filli right now...

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:23.500
It's okay. We'll find him tomorrow.

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:25.500
I understand how you feel,

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:27.870
but you should eat while you have the chance.

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:33.700
Filli... I wonder if he's going
hungry somewhere right now?

00:14:49.100 --> 00:14:53.400
Tomorrow, we'll make 1000 gold coins...

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:53.400
Tomorrow, we'll make 1000 gold coins...

00:14:53.400 --> 00:14:57.360
Tomorrow, we'll make 1000 gold coins...

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:57.360
Tomorrow, we'll make 1000 gold coins...

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:09.380
Tomorrow we'll...

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:12.700
Lief.

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:13.880
Lief!

00:15:14.500 --> 00:15:15.900
Wake up, Lief.

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:19.500
What?

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:21.200
Jasmine is gone.

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:22.220
Huh?!

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:41.440
Jasmine must have gone out
during the night to look for him.

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:45.450
But even so, there was no need
to leave without telling us...

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:49.700
Filli is an irreplaceable friend to Jasmine.

00:15:49.700 --> 00:15:53.200
No, he's more like family, you see.

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:56.100
Lief...!

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:00.900
Are you alright, Lief?

00:16:00.900 --> 00:16:02.000
Yeah.

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:06.900
This place is...

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:09.400
The underground tunnel from back then.

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:10.800
Hey, Lief.

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:12.800
Could that mean that over that way is...

00:16:12.800 --> 00:16:13.900
Yeah.

00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:15.190
Let's take a look.

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:31.000
Is this... Mother Brightly's hideout?

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:33.200
Yeah, most likely.

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:38.300
As I thought, you came back here.

00:16:38.300 --> 00:16:43.000
Filli has... gotten mixed up in something serious.

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:44.200
Jasmine...?

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:49.140
It looks like a big confrontation took place here.

00:16:50.300 --> 00:16:52.700
What on earth happened?

00:16:54.300 --> 00:16:55.700
Filli...

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:58.150
What awful things have you gone through?

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:03.900
This is...

00:17:03.900 --> 00:17:06.280
"Pet Fair"?

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:09.280
What does it mean by "fair"?

00:17:09.700 --> 00:17:11.900
I'm not entirely sure,

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:16.000
but it's probably a place where
people show off and trade animals.

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:18.000
Then, Filli is...!

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:22.300
How awful... buying and
selling animals like that...!

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:25.900
Wait a moment...

00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:30.260
If that's the case, could it mean Mother Brightly is...

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:34.100
I see! So that's how it is.

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:36.200
Jasmine, rest assured.

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:37.800
Filli is safe.

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:40.800
Why do you say that?

00:17:50.400 --> 00:17:55.600
Mother Brightly is probably
planning to sell Filli at this fair.

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:57.300
Sell Filli?!

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:59.100
I won't let her do that!

00:17:59.100 --> 00:18:02.090
All of these people must have
something wrong with them!

00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:04.600
Calm down, Jasmine!

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:09.500
Either way, Mother Brightly
should be around here somewhere.

00:18:09.500 --> 00:18:12.200
Let's just wait for her to show up.

00:18:21.900 --> 00:18:25.360
1000 gold coins... 1000 gold coins...

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:30.400
With a full belly, it seems
to have finally calmed down.

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:34.100
Now then, Miss Mother Brightly.

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:36.000
Please prepare your animal.

00:18:37.600 --> 00:18:38.800
At last...

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:42.080
At last, the 1000 gold coins will be mine!

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:47.400
Now, my little 1000 gold coins.

00:18:47.400 --> 00:18:50.200
Let's give you a final touch-up.

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:07.480
My little 1000 gold coins!

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:11.200
Hold on! It's still dangerous out there!

00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:12.030
Dangerous?!

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:16.030
We're in the middle of the
'Fierce Beasts' part of the show!

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:18.290
"Fierce Beasts" you say...?

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:20.040
Don't give me that crap!

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:22.700
If it gets hurt by those beasts,

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:25.540
all of my suffering up until
now will have been for nothing!

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:36.200
What is going on?

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:37.200
It's Filli!

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:38.140
Huh?!

00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:45.900
Let's go, Barda.

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:46.800
Yeah.

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:49.000
What the heck is that?

00:19:50.400 --> 00:19:51.800
I've found you!

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:54.100
You won't be getting away from me now!

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:54.910
That's...!

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:08.400
<i>My suffering up until now...</i>

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:13.510
<i>Do you really think I'd just
let these 1000 coins slip away?!</i>

00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:20.300
That's Mother Brightly, right...?

00:20:20.300 --> 00:20:21.500
Yeah...

00:20:21.500 --> 00:20:24.560
Something about her seems
quite different, though...

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:26.600
Filli!

00:20:30.300 --> 00:20:31.700
Thank goodness.

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:32.600
Filli...

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:34.900
Hold on, Birdie!

00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:37.100
B-Birdie...

00:20:37.100 --> 00:20:39.080
Are you talking to me...?

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:48.400
I'm not giving away those 1000 gold coins!

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:50.900
What are you talking about?! I'm going to...

00:20:49.900 --> 00:20:50.900
There it is!

00:20:50.900 --> 00:20:55.600
Could that be the elusive
animal, Obaobopipiru?!

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:59.350
It really is! This is my first time
seeing one live in the flesh!

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:02.400
Hey, you. Will you sell that to me?

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:05.200
I'll give you 1000, no 1200 gold coins!

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:07.400
I will pay 2000 gold coins!

00:21:07.400 --> 00:21:10.300
Silence! That thing is mine!

00:21:10.300 --> 00:21:14.800
What's with you people?! Filli belongs
to no one, and I'm not selling him!

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:15.900
What...?

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:17.360
This isn't it.

00:21:17.800 --> 00:21:19.000
Huh?

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:20.900
This isn't it...?

00:21:20.900 --> 00:21:24.870
It certainly looks similar,
but it's not an Obaobopipiru.

00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:26.500
Uh,

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:29.400
look, here. This fur... here!

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:32.100
You're right.

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:35.300
Geez, so it's just some furball rat, then.

00:21:35.300 --> 00:21:37.630
What a letdown after all that.

00:21:38.100 --> 00:21:41.600
J-Just a... furball?

00:21:41.600 --> 00:21:45.000
1000 gold coins... 1000 gold coins...

00:21:56.100 --> 00:21:58.150
For crying out loud!

00:21:58.700 --> 00:22:01.700
Well excuse me for having "just a furball rat"!

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:03.800
I hope they get what's coming to them!

00:22:03.800 --> 00:22:05.900
Well, isn't that a good thing?

00:22:05.900 --> 00:22:07.700
He's right, Jasmine.

00:22:07.700 --> 00:22:10.700
Isn't it good that he's just a furball?

00:22:12.800 --> 00:22:14.400
Well, I guess you're right.

00:22:18.300 --> 00:22:21.300
By the way, Filli, did you...

00:22:21.300 --> 00:22:24.680
perhaps get a little heavier?

00:22:36.290 --> 00:22:40.460
Bye-bye, thank you! The memories that we shared

00:22:40.460 --> 00:22:45.550
are like a never-fading diamond

00:22:46.180 --> 00:22:50.560
Non-stop, I'm not going to hit the brakes

00:22:50.560 --> 00:22:55.640
I have to continue making this album

00:22:56.310 --> 00:23:00.980
Three springtimes have passed since then

00:23:00.980 --> 00:23:05.320
but I still remember you

00:23:07.030 --> 00:23:11.790
In this ever-changing city landscape

00:23:12.080 --> 00:23:16.160
I'm going out today, wearing a new pair of shoes

00:23:16.160 --> 00:23:20.210
in search of tomorrow

00:23:20.630 --> 00:23:24.710
In this corner of the world

00:23:24.710 --> 00:23:30.430
it really is a miracle that we met each other

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:34.810
It's great to know that today and tomorrow

00:23:34.810 --> 00:23:37.940
we will be seeing each other countless times

00:23:37.940 --> 00:23:40.310
Thank you

00:23:40.400 --> 00:23:44.900
Let's chase after our hopes and dreams

00:23:44.900 --> 00:23:50.740
and with a deep breath, say "good morning" to the sun

00:23:50.910 --> 00:23:56.290
Our hearts feel the time passing by, so hold me tight

00:23:56.290 --> 00:24:00.040
and we can start running towards our next adventure

00:24:06.600 --> 00:24:11.200
A surviving Grey Guard, Number 6 of
his pod, is living quietly in the forest.

00:24:11.200 --> 00:24:15.000
The villagers are afraid of
him and keep their distance,

00:24:15.000 --> 00:24:17.840
but he's actually a kind-hearted person.

00:24:18.400 --> 00:24:21.800
He says that he wants to
get along with everyone, but...

00:24:23.700 --> 00:24:26.590
Next time, "The Lonely Grey Guard".

00:24:27.200 --> 00:24:30.890
Lief, Barda, can we really trust him?

00:24:28.860 --> 00:24:34.830
The Lonely Grey Guard

00:24:30.890 --> 00:24:34.810
He <i>is</i> a Grey Guard, you know?!

00:24:49.840 --> 00:24:54.800
See you next time
